<title>USA: Fortress Group to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Fortress Group to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Fortress Group Inc said on Friday it authorized the repurchase of up to 350,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Purchases will be made from time to time in the open market, the company said, and will be used in the company's employee stock purchase plan and other employee compensation plans.</p>
<p>Fortress said certain officers and directors of the company may purchase shares of Fortress stock individually.</p>
<p>The company had about 11.8 million shares outstanding as of Sept. 30.</p>
